# PWA, mobile first

Stack: `docs/architecture/` (one React TypeScript PWA, same origin).

- Customer target is a mobile browser/PWA. Owner dashboard must still work on a phone.
- Guest browsing has no login wall. Email+password at request submit / My Bookings / owner. Phone OTP required to send a request; email verified before request or owner routes.
- Bosnian-first copy. Prices in KM. Do not default to English-only or EUR.
- Keep the QR / Instagram-bio → salon page → request path to one tap where possible.
- Drag-to-propose on the owner panel always has a tap/form fallback.
- Verify UI changes in the browser (behavior, not only a screenshot), including related routes that share state.
